## 🛡️ FRP & Device Security

**Factory Reset Protection (FRP)** is a security feature designed to help protect Android devices after an unauthorized factory reset.

FRP-related servicing must only be performed on a device that the technician or owner is authorized to service. Modern Samsung security updates can also make older FRP-related methods incompatible with newer devices.

### 🔐 Security Considerations

* 🛡️ Verify device ownership
* 📱 Confirm the exact Samsung model
* 🔍 Check Android version
* ⚙️ Check security patch level
* 🧾 Keep proof of legitimate ownership when required
* 🔐 Use official account-recovery options where applicable
* 🛠️ Follow authorized service procedures

